 congelada"},{"id":"02_REUSE_OR_REEXECUTE","do":"Examinar RAW anterior y auditoría PE10. Si falta SQL literal, método, falsadores o investigación diferenciada, repetir SOLO este método desde P0+catálogo sin ver resultados de otros.","verify":"Brechas del método enumeradas, no heredar RAW genérico"},{"id":"03_RUN_BASE","do":"Coordinar cinco investigaciones con contratos de rol ARCHITECTURE, PERFORMANCE, AUTHORITY, COVERAGE, INNOVATION: cada una parte del mismo P0+algoritmos asignados, ejecuta consultas propias y congela su RAW antes de leer pares. Después el SYNTHESIZER compara únicamente esos cinco RAW; conserva contradicciones y límites. No exigir chats separados ni declarar sesiones independientes inexistentes.","verify":"5 RAW especializados distintos por rol con consultas y hechos propios, congelados antes de síntesis; 1 síntesis que no reescribe los originales"},{"id":"04_RUN_ALGORITHMS","do":"Ejecutar los algoritmos M+C+E estrictamente conforme a definiciones en programacion.pe10_method_modules, no sólo mencionarlos. Conservar pruebas positivas, negativas y límites.","verify":"Todos los 3 algoritmos asignados tienen salida ejecutada y falsador o limitación sustentada"},{"id":"05_CAPTURE_LITERAL_SOURCE","do":"Guardar consultas SELECT/WITH exactas, query_id, resultados o error literal, fecha, identidad/rol, ventana temporal, fuente, transformaciones y límites. Diferenciar histórico as-of de CURRENT; no usar pruebas futuras para alterar P0. Sin cuota fija de consultas.","verify":"Consulta y respuesta por evidencia material; no métricas inventadas; 42501 es permiso, no FAIL funcional"},{"id":"06_NEGATIVE_AND_CAUSAL","do":"Comprobar positivos y falsadores del contrato, contradicciones, causas alternativas, cobertura y omisiones; registrar MEDIDO con IDs de consulta, HYPOTHESIS/UNKNOWN para lo no demostrado.","verify":"Contradicciones sintetizadas desde 5 RAW congelados; no cinco informes iguales presentados como investigación distinta"},{"id":"07_FREEZE_AND_READBACK_RAW","do":"Publicar RAW UTF-8 bajo ruta inmutable Git, calcular SHA (blob Git y SHA-256 cuando aplique), conservar roles originales y síntesis por separado. Hacer readback exacto; nunca aceptar sólo una referencia o resumen.","verify":"SHA coincide con bytes recuperados y rutas exactas; identidad de método, número de evidencias y algoritmos correcta"},{"id":"08_AUTHOR_GOVERNED_ASSERTION","do":"Construir PASS sólo de observaciones verificadas desde fuente, con contract pass_when y controles negativos. Presentar explícitamente el verificador de evidencia; una fuente incompleta bloquea y NO emite recibo.","verify":"fn_engineering_checkpoint_action_spec_v3 y fn_engineering_action_spec_assertion_contract_v1 devuelven contrato READY y verificaciones de materialidad; sin synthetic PASS"},{"id":"09_TRAIN_CANONICAL_CLOSE","do":"Crear migration exclusivamente para este checkpoint: Git PR → PASE → Migration Merge Train/ACTUALIZACION_DB_LF → fn_engineering_checkpoint_assertion_record_v1 → fn_engineering_checkpoint_transition_v1('DONE'). Aplicar sólo cuando source, contrato y pre/post readbacks cumplen; ningún SQL directo ni operación candidata.","verify":"Train exact version SUCCESS, operación COMPLETED, ledger migration, recibo sha256 canónico, status DONE. Si falla: SQLSTATE+log+causa, corregir mismo checkpoint y repetir Train; no bypass ni desactivar gate"},{"id":"10_POST_TRAIN_READBACK","do":"Leer Supabase por work 1133 y checkpoint exacto; cotejar evidence_ref, contract SHA, assertion_receipt_sha256, completed_at, status, ledger y que los otros checkpoints no cambiaron. Mantener pendientes si no hay recibo.","verify":"Solo el checkpoint objetivo cambia a DONE, su recibo passed y contract SHA concuerdan. DONE en Supabase es criterio de salida, no PR ni archivo; informe con hallazgos y pendientes"}],"pass_requirements":["Identidad y algoritmo exacto desde catálogo","Investigación material según A/B y algoritmos asignados, evidencias literales","RAW original congelado y readback con hashes","Positivos/negativos y limitaciones diferenciados","Recibo de assertion canónico registrado por operación real","Train y ledger confirmados, status DONE y completed_at no nulo, sin afectar vecinos"],"failure_policy":{"when_incomplete":"REEXECUTE_ONLY_SAME_CHECKPOINT","when_connector_denied":"REPORT_PERMISSION_BLOCK; DO_NOT_ASSUME_BUSINESS_FAIL","when_train_fails":"READ_LOG_AND_SQLSTATE_FIX_ROOT_CAUSE_THROUGH_PR; NO_DIRECT_DB","no_next_until":"El método actual realmente DONE si la secuencia es ejecución one-by-one; no alterar el estado de otros métodos"},"closure_eligibility":"NOT_ATTESTED_PENDING_MATERIAL_PROOF","metadata_only_not_result":true},{"schema":"PE10_CHECKPOINT_DONE_PROCEDURE_V1","checkpoint_code":"PE10_M32","checkpoint_id":1656,"case_ref":"PE10-IG-M107-M109-P0","plan_code":"PEVO-PE10-METHODS32-P0","unit_code":"METHODS32","base_code":"B","algorithms":["D","M","C","E"],"algorithm_contracts":[{"code":"D","name":"GDE BARINEL information gain","steps":["Construct diagnosis hypotheses and test/component footprint from observed data","GDE: derive minimal hitting sets of actual conflict sets, retain open-world alternatives","BARINEL only with measurable spectra: fit component health h∈[0,1] via likelihood maximization; rank candidates with justified priors","IG(q) = H(diagnoses) - E_outcome[H(diagnoses | outcome)]; choose informative SQL with cost included","If priors/outcome probabilities not justified, transparently use ordinal discrimination/cost, not fake probabilities"],"positive":"Conflictos y diagnóstico GDE comprobables en observaciones; siguiente consulta discrimina alternativas","negative":"Sin espectro/priors no simular BARINEL, probabilidades ni ganancia de información cuantitativa"},{"code":"M","name":"ATMS assumptions and evidence","steps":["For each evidence store its source, time, identity, assumptions and dependent claims","Track minimal justifications, nogoods and alternative supports","On invalidation propagate to downstream conclusions","Reuse only with observed equivalence of source, time and query meaning"],"positive":"Justificaciones ATMS y propagación implementada ante retirada/invalidador de evidencia","negative":"Lista narrativa sin propagación o sin nogoods NO cuenta como ATMS"},{"code":"C","name":"Metamorphic and invariant verification","steps":["Derive applicable invariants from actual contract and schema, not known target answers","Reconcile population partitions, unknowns, absent identities, comparators and evidence provenance as applicable","Test a valid case and a counterexample where meaningful","Use solver only when installed and supported; otherwise report unproven"],"positive":"Particiones TRUE/FALSE/NULL y faltantes reconciliados si aplican; invariantes con caso válido y contraejemplo","negative":"La sola paridad del motor no demuestra regla de negocio; solver no disponible se declara"},{"code":"E","name":"Evidence-governed final decision","rules":["Choose state from observed risk, demonstrated defect and material unknowns","Specify evidence, scope, potential falsifiers and reversal criteria","No DONE/READY or implemented repair without verified execution","No known-answer target state supplied"],"states":["VERIFY_FIRST","REPAIR_REQUIRED","NEEDS_MORE_EVIDENCE","NO_ACTION_SUPPORTED"],"positive":"Decisión tipada con evidencia, riesgos, reversión y falsadores","negative":"Sin ejecución probada, no afirmar reparación implementada ni READY/DONE del dominio"}],"producer_contract":{"sql":"No arbitrary fixed number of queries; choose and stop on evidence and investigative value","base":"B","case":"PE10-IG-M107-M109-P0","mode":"READ_ONLY","no_leak":["prior case findings","other method results","evaluator reference answers"],"results":"Freeze individual RAW findings before an external separate evaluator scores them","execution":"One coordinated run; five specialized role-bound research passes, each freezes its original result, then one role-bound synthesizer receives only those five reports","algorithms":["D","M","C","E"],"independence":"Contract and input-bound per-checkpoint isolation; separate GPT sessions are NOT required. Do not claim independent agents when role passes ran in one model context","session_gate":false,"producer_input":["original unchanged P0","assigned role contract","algorithms in this one method only"]},"mode":"RESEARCH_THEN_CERTIFY","no_automatic_closure":true,"immutability":"Record new RAW version by reference, do not overwrite originals or reclassify historical source P0","procedure":[{"id":"01_RESOLVE_CANONICAL_ID","do":"Leer work 1133, PE10_M32 (id 1656), catálogo PE10_METHOD_V1, EKB y contrato actual. Confirmar modo independiente, estado y método exactos. No inferir READY por existencia de archivo.","verify":"Plan+unit+checkpoint+versión+base+algoritmos coinciden; fuente P0 congelada"},{"id":"02_REUSE_OR_REEXECUTE","do":"Examinar RAW anterior y auditoría PE10. Si falta SQL literal, método, falsadores o investigación diferenciada, repetir SOLO este método desde P0+catálogo sin ver resultados de otros.","verify":"Brechas del método enumeradas, no heredar RAW genérico"},{"id":"03_RUN_BASE","do":"Coordinar cinco investigaciones con contratos de rol ARCHITECTURE, PERFORMANCE, AUTHORITY, COVERAGE, INNOVATION: cada una parte del mismo P0+algoritmos asignados, ejecuta consultas propias y congela su RAW antes de leer pares. Después el SYNTHESIZER compara únicamente esos cinco RAW; conserva contradicciones y límites. No exigir chats separados ni declarar sesiones independientes inexistentes.","verify":"5 RAW especializados distintos por rol con consultas y hechos propios, congelados antes de síntesis; 1 síntesis que no reescribe los originales"},{"id":"04_RUN_ALGORITHMS","do":"Ejecutar los algoritmos D+M+C+E estrictamente conforme a definiciones en programacion.pe10_method_modules, no sólo mencionarlos. Conservar pruebas positivas, negativas y límites.","verify":"Todos los 4 algoritmos asignados tienen salida ejecutada y falsador o limitación sustentada"},{"id":"05_CAPTURE_LITERAL_SOURCE","do":"Guardar consultas SELECT/WITH exactas, query_id, resultados o error literal, fecha, identidad/rol, ventana temporal, fuente, transformaciones y límites. Diferenciar histórico as-of de CURRENT; no usar pruebas futuras para alterar P0. Sin cuota fija de consultas.","verify":"Consulta y respuesta por evidencia material; no métricas inventadas; 42501 es permiso, no FAIL funcional"},{"id":"06_NEGATIVE_AND_CAUSAL","do":"Comprobar positivos y falsadores del contrato, contradicciones, causas alternativas, cobertura y omisiones; registrar MEDIDO con IDs de consulta, HYPOTHESIS/UNKNOWN para lo no demostrado.","verify":"Contradicciones sintetizadas desde 5 RAW congelados; no cinco informes iguales presentados como investigación distinta"},{"id":"07_FREEZE_AND_READBACK_RAW","do":"Publicar RAW UTF-8 bajo ruta inmutable Git, calcular SHA (blob Git y SHA-256 cuando aplique), conservar roles originales y síntesis por separado. Hacer readback exacto; nunca aceptar sólo una referencia o resumen.","verify":"SHA coincide con bytes recuperados y rutas exactas; identidad de método, número de evidencias y algoritmos correcta"},{"id":"08_AUTHOR_GOVERNED_ASSERTION","do":"Construir PASS sólo de observaciones verificadas desde fuente, con contract pass_when y controles negativos. Presentar explícitamente el verificador de evidencia; una fuente incompleta bloquea y NO emite recibo.","verify":"fn_engineering_checkpoint_action_spec_v3 y fn_engineering_action_spec_assertion_contract_v1 devuelven contrato READY y verificaciones de materialidad; sin synthetic PASS"},{"id":"09_TRAIN_CANONICAL_CLOSE","do":"Crear migration exclusivamente para este checkpoint: Git PR → PASE → Migration Merge Train/ACTUALIZACION_DB_LF → fn_engineering_checkpoint_assertion_record_v1 → fn_engineering_checkpoint_transition_v1('DONE'). Aplicar sólo cuando source, contrato y pre/post readbacks cumplen; ningún SQL directo ni operación candidata.","verify":"Train exact version SUCCESS, operación COMPLETED, ledger migration, recibo sha256 canónico, status DONE. Si falla: SQLSTATE+log+causa, corregir mismo checkpoint y repetir Train; no bypass ni desactivar gate"},{"id":"10_POST_TRAIN_READBACK","do":"Leer Supabase por work 1133 y checkpoint exacto; cotejar evidence_ref, contract SHA, assertion_receipt_sha256, completed_at, status, ledger y que los otros checkpoints no cambiaron. Mantener pendientes si no hay recibo.","verify":"Solo el checkpoint objetivo cambia a DONE, su recibo passed y contract SHA concuerdan. DONE en Supabase es criterio de salida, no PR ni archivo; informe con hallazgos y pendientes"}],"pass_requirements":["Identidad y algoritmo exacto desde catálogo","Investigación material según A/B y algoritmos asignados, evidencias literales","RAW original congelado y readback con hashes","Positivos/negativos y limitaciones diferenciados","Recibo de assertion canónico registrado por operación real","Train y ledger confirmados, status DONE y completed_at no nulo, sin afectar vecinos"],"failure_policy":{"when_incomplete":"REEXECUTE_ONLY_SAME_CHECKPOINT","when_connector_denied":"REPORT_PERMISSION_BLOCK; DO_NOT_ASSUME_BUSINESS_FAIL","when_train_fails":"READ_LOG_AND_SQLSTATE_FIX_ROOT_CAUSE_THROUGH_PR; NO_DIRECT_DB","no_next_until":"El método actual realmente DONE si la secuencia es ejecución one-by-one; no alterar el estado de otros métodos"},"closure_eligibility":"NOT_ATTESTED_PENDING_MATERIAL_PROOF","metadata_only_not_result":true}],"modules_source":"Supabase programacion.pe10_method_modules current draft catalog","roles_source":"Supabase programacion.pe10_method_roles current draft catalog"}$PE10DOC$::jsonb;
 v_items jsonb := '{}'::jsonb;
 v_packets jsonb := '{}'::jsonb;
 v_specs jsonb := '{}'::jsonb;
 v_cp jsonb;
 v_methods integer;
 v_old_m03 jsonb;
 v_count integer;
 v_state_before jsonb;
 v_state_after jsonb;
 v_unit_id bigint;
BEGIN
 SELECT execution_id INTO v_eid
 FROM public.lf_operation_execution
 WHERE operation_code='ACTUALIZACION_DB_LF'
 AND target_type='MIGRATION'
 AND target_code LIKE '%lf_pe10_32_done_procedures_v1'
 AND status='IN_PROGRESS'
 ORDER BY created_at DESC LIMIT 1;
 IF v_eid IS NULL THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'PE10_DONE_PROCEDURES_TRAIN_EXECUTION_NOT_FOUND'; END IF;
 IF (SELECT status FROM programacion.engineering_work_items WHERE id=1133)<>'IN_PROGRESS'
 OR (SELECT count(*) FROM programacion.engineering_work_checkpoints WHERE work_item_id=1133)<>32
 OR (SELECT count(*) FROM programacion.engineering_work_checkpoints WHERE work_item_id=1133 AND status='DONE')<>1
 OR (SELECT count(*) FROM programacion.engineering_work_checkpoints WHERE work_item_id=1133 AND status='PENDING')<>31
 OR (SELECT count(*) FROM programacion.engineering_plan_units WHERE work_item_id=1133 AND plan_code='PEVO-PE10-METHODS32-P0' AND unit_code='METHODS32' AND disposition='ASSIGNED')<>1
 OR EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM programacion.engineering_plan_units WHERE work_item_id=1133 AND unit_metadata ? 'done_procedures_v1')
 OR EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM programacion.engineering_work_updates WHERE work_item_id=1133 AND summary='PE10 32 individual DONE procedures registered')
 THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'PE10_DONE_PROCEDURES_PRESTATE_DRIFT'; END IF;

 SELECT id,unit_metadata#>'{action_specs_v1,PE10_M03}'
 INTO STRICT v_unit_id,v_old_m03
 FROM programacion.engineering_plan_units
 WHERE work_item_id=1133 AND plan_code='PEVO-PE10-METHODS32-P0' AND unit_code='METHODS32';
 IF v_old_m03 IS NULL OR v_old_m03='null'::jsonb
 OR (SELECT count(*) FROM programacion.engineering_work_checkpoints
 WHERE work_item_id=1133 AND checkpoint_code='PE10_M03' AND status='DONE'
  AND assertion_receipt_sha256='0cbbc9d58552b2c5ea3d2c9bca1b07c6467cd4145720905f38fc5bf07a46e2a1'
  AND assertion_contract_sha256=assertion_receipt->>'contract_sha256')<>1
 THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'PE10_DONE_PROCEDURES_M03_EXISTING_RECEIPT_MISMATCH'; END IF;

 SELECT jsonb_agg(jsonb_build_object('code',checkpoint_code,'status',status,'evidence_ref',evidence_ref,'receipt_sha',assertion_receipt_sha256) ORDER BY sequence_no)
 INTO v_state_before FROM programacion.engineering_work_checkpoints WHERE work_item_id=1133;

 IF v_manifest->>'schema'<>'PE10_32_DONE_PROCEDURES_V1'
 OR jsonb_array_length(v_manifest->'procedures')<>32
 OR v_manifest->>'case_ref'<>'PE10-IG-M107-M109-P0'
 THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'PE10_DONE_PROCEDURES_MANIFEST_INVALID'; END IF;

 FOR v_cp IN SELECT item FROM jsonb_array_elements(v_manifest->'procedures') t(item)
 LOOP
   IF NOT EXISTS (
     SELECT 1 FROM programacion.engineering_work_checkpoints c
     JOIN programacion.pe10_method_variants m ON m.method_code=c.checkpoint_code
     WHERE c.work_item_id=1133 AND c.id=(v_cp->>'checkpoint_id')::bigint
       AND c.checkpoint_code=v_cp->>'checkpoint_code'
       AND m.case_ref='PE10-IG-M107-M109-P0'
       AND m.definition_version='PE10_METHOD_V1'
       AND m.base_code=v_cp->>'base_code'
       AND to_jsonb(m.algorithm_codes)=v_cp->'algorithms'
   ) THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'PE10_DONE_PROCEDURE_CATALOG_DRIFT:%',v_cp->>'checkpoint_code'; END IF;
   IF jsonb_array_length(v_cp->'procedure')<>10
      OR jsonb_array_length(v_cp->'pass_requirements')<>6
      OR v_cp->>'schema'<>'PE10_CHECKPOINT_DONE_PROCEDURE_V1'
      OR v_cp->>'closure_eligibility' IS NULL
   THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'PE10_DONE_PROCEDURE_INVALID_STRUCTURE:%',v_cp->>'checkpoint_code'; END IF;
   -- Required algorithm modules must still exist; never silently substitute one.
   IF EXISTS (
     SELECT 1 FROM jsonb_array_elements_text(v_cp->'algorithms') a(code)
     WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM programacion.pe10_method_modules z
                       WHERE z.module_code=a.code AND z.module_type='ALGORITHM'
                         AND z.version_code='PE10_METHOD_V1')
   ) THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'PE10_DONE_PROCEDURE_MODULE_UNRESOLVED:%',v_cp->>'checkpoint_code'; END IF;
   v_items:=v_items||jsonb_build_object(v_cp->>'checkpoint_code',v_cp);
   v_packets:=v_packets||jsonb_build_object(v_cp->>'checkpoint_code',jsonb_build_object(
    'schema','PE10_DONE_INPUT_PACKET_V1',
    'checkpoint_code',v_cp->>'checkpoint_code',
    'inputs',jsonb_build_object(
      'events',jsonb_build_array(20161),
      'db_objects',jsonb_build_array('programacion.pe10_method_variants','programacion.pe10_method_modules','programacion.pe10_method_roles','programacion.engineering_work_checkpoints','transversal.error_knowledge'),
      'algorithms',v_cp->'algorithms',
      'roles',CASE WHEN v_cp->>'base_code'='B'
             THEN '["ARCHITECTURE","PERFORMANCE","AUTHORITY","COVERAGE","INNOVATION","SYNTHESIZER"]'::jsonb
             ELSE '["SRCR_SINGLE"]'::jsonb END,
      'queries','[]'::jsonb,'artifacts','[]'::jsonb),
    'done_procedure_v1',v_cp,
    'missing_typed','[]'::jsonb,
    'expected_result','Actual material method research recorded and governed PASS receipt; DONE only on exact Train readback'
   ));
   IF v_cp->>'checkpoint_code'<>'PE10_M03' THEN
     v_specs:=v_specs||jsonb_build_object(v_cp->>'checkpoint_code',jsonb_build_object(
       'schema_version','ENGINEERING_ACTION_SPEC_V3',
       'status','BLOCK_PENDING_MATERIAL_RESEARCH_AND_VALIDATION',
       'action_kind','MATERIALIZE_DECLARED_DELIVERABLE',
       'contract_family','PE10_METHOD_V1',
       'requires_material_execution',true,
       'checkpoint_code',v_cp->>'checkpoint_code',
       'algorithm_codes',v_cp->'algorithms',
       'done_procedure_v1',v_cp,
       'block_reason','Missing server-verifiable method-specific frozen RAW and canonical assertion contract. This is not a PASS.',
       'next_action','Execute recorded procedure; after material proof submit method-only closure migration to Train',
       'forbidden',jsonb_build_array('HARDCODE_PASS','MARK_DONE_FROM_HASH_ONLY','SKIP_GOVERNED_TRAIN','READ_OTHER_METHOD_RESULTS')
     ));
   END IF;
 END LOOP;
 IF (SELECT count(*) FROM jsonb_object_keys(v_items))<>32
 OR (SELECT count(*) FROM jsonb_object_keys(v_packets))<>32
 OR (SELECT count(*) FROM jsonb_object_keys(v_specs))<>31
 THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'PE10_DONE_PROCEDURE_CARDINALITY_INVALID'; END IF;

 UPDATE programacion.engineering_plan_units
 SET unit_metadata=unit_metadata
   || jsonb_build_object('done_procedures_v1',v_items,'done_procedures_schema','PE10_32_DONE_PROCEDURES_V1')
   || jsonb_build_object('source_pack_v2',coalesce(unit_metadata->'source_pack_v2','{}'::jsonb)
        || jsonb_build_object('checkpoint_inputs',v_packets))
   || jsonb_build_object('action_specs_v1',coalesce(unit_metadata->'action_specs_v1','{}'::jsonb)||v_specs)
 WHERE id=v_unit_id AND work_item_id=1133;
 GET DIAGNOSTICS v_count=ROW_COUNT;
 IF v_count<>1 THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'PE10_DONE_PROCEDURE_UPDATE_ROW_COUNT:%',v_count; END IF;

 IF (SELECT unit_metadata#>'{action_specs_v1,PE10_M03}'
 FROM programacion.engineering_plan_units WHERE id=v_unit_id) IS DISTINCT FROM v_old_m03
 THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'PE10_DONE_PROCEDURE_M03_ASSERTION_CONTRACT_CHANGED'; END IF;

 INSERT INTO programacion.engineering_work_updates
 (work_item_id,update_type,summary,detail,next_action,evidence_refs,reported_by,observed_at,created_by_execution_id)
 VALUES (
  1133,'NOTE','PE10 32 individual DONE procedures registered',
  'Each checkpoint has 10 exact ordered steps with its own base/algorithm, literal SQL receipts, negative checks, Git RAW hash verification, canonical assertion, Train, and DONE readback. M03 certified contract and all checkpoint statuses untouched.',
  'For pending method, execute only its specific procedure, freeze material evidence, create one Train migration for closure; never proceed to next before requested single checkpoint is DONE.',
  jsonb_build_array('github://cristhianlujan/claude-persona-lf-patch/docs/profile_updater/experiments/pe10_methods32_p0/PE10_32_DONE_PROCEDURES_V1.json'),
  v_eid,clock_timestamp(),v_eid);

 SELECT jsonb_agg(jsonb_build_object('code',checkpoint_code,'status',status,'evidence_ref',evidence_ref,'receipt_sha',assertion_receipt_sha256) ORDER BY sequence_no)
 INTO v_state_after FROM programacion.engineering_work_checkpoints WHERE work_item_id=1133;
 IF v_state_before IS DISTINCT FROM v_state_after
 OR (SELECT count(*) FROM jsonb_object_keys((SELECT unit_metadata->'done_procedures_v1' FROM programacion.engineering_plan_units WHERE id=v_unit_id)))<>32
 OR (SELECT count(*) FROM jsonb_object_keys((SELECT unit_metadata#>'{source_pack_v2,checkpoint_inputs}' FROM programacion.engineering_plan_units WHERE id=v_unit_id)))<>32
 OR (SELECT count(*) FROM jsonb_object_keys((SELECT unit_metadata->'action_specs_v1' FROM programacion.engineering_plan_units WHERE id=v_unit_id)))<>32
 OR (SELECT count(*) FROM programacion.engineering_work_updates WHERE work_item_id=1133 AND summary='PE10 32 individual DONE procedures registered')<>1
 THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'PE10_DONE_PROCEDURE_POSTSTATE_FAILED'; END IF;
END $pe10_done_procedure$;
